# The deployed gateway. `NEXT_PUBLIC_` is required for Next.js to inline
# this into the browser bundle — which is safe here: this is a public URL,
# not a secret. No key, prompt, or provider name ever reaches this app (see
# lib/gateway.js).
#
# Committed on purpose, unlike .env.local: this is the production default,
# and a missing value would silently fall back to http://localhost:8000 in
# a deployed build — a portal that looks fine and can never reach anything.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL=https://api.cognihire.online

# The intake Google Form (Ticket 11) — resume upload, role, and preferred
# interview time are all collected there, not on this site. See
# infra/google-form-apps-script.gs for what forwards each submission to
# intake-webhook. NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_FORM_EMAIL_ENTRY is unset for now —
# GoogleFormGate degrades to a plain redirect (no email pre-fill) until it's
# added.
# Must be the live form of an ACTIVE row in `intakes` — the intake-webhook
# resolves each submission's formId against `intakes.google_form_id` and
# rejects anything that isn't a known active intake, so a form that is not
# registered produces a candidate who silently never exists.
#
# The previous value (…1FAIpQLSdo29I9x2AW…) returns HTTP 401: it is not public,
# and it is not the form registered to any intake. Anyone following the portal's
# apply link could not even open it. Replaced with the form belonging to the
# only active intake — "August 2026 Intake" → Backend Engineer — verified
# returning HTTP 200.
#
# If you open a second intake, this single global URL becomes the wrong shape
# for the problem: prefer linking candidates to `/apply/<roleId>`, which is
# per-role by construction. Note the tradeoff — the portal apply form does not
# collect a preferred interview time, so a candidate arriving that way gets
# `window_start = NULL` and is skipped by the reminder sweep. Only the Google
# Form path schedules reminders today.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_FORM_URL=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoH9Tt0D1uUWmnJgwHpkgG0CUjj9jy5IulYLw0NYleB1X_1Q/viewform
